{"script":"s_4_11_5","exps":[{"para":{"tag":"tag_1"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara2"},"key":"top"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"索洛罗哆","text":"[show]呜……对、对不起……还让你们来救我……像、像像我这种垃圾蕈人，就应该去死……不仅会伤害周边的人，还会伤害到朋友噗……[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_2"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"维罗莎","text":"[show]别哭了啦，我不是还好好的吗？放心，那药水对我没有任何伤害啦！[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_3"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"索洛罗哆","text":"[show]真……真的吗噗？[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_4"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"维罗莎","text":"[show]当然是真的，我不因为这件事情苛责你啦。虽然最后药水没有起到效果，但还是感谢你的心意。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_5"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"维罗莎","text":"[show]而且你也不用担心我嗅觉恢复后会嫌弃你。你是我最好的伙伴，无论如何我都不会嫌弃你的。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_6"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"维罗莎","text":"[show]其实……我小时候也因为闻不出味道，总是被嘲笑。明明身为大厨的孩子，却没有嗅觉。大家都把臭臭的东西放到我鼻子前捉弄我，最后都不愿意跟我玩了。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_7"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"维罗莎","text":"[show]在我最寂寞的时候，是你来到了我身边。你因为无法控制而被大家嫌弃，而我也因为没有嗅觉而遭大家的鄙夷，我们两人能相遇正是命运的安排。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_8"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"维罗莎","text":"[show]和你一起玩耍的时光很开心，我们在这期间建立起的纽带，是无论如何也不会断掉的。不管我是否恢复嗅觉，我都不会离开你的。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_9"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"索洛罗哆","text":"[show]呜呜……维……维罗莎……能认识你……真的太好啦噗……[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_10"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"noIn":false,"mirrow":false,"alpha":0,"addImg":"","layer":"bg","x":-500,"y":-125,"scaleX":1.5,"trans":true,"bright":1,"noOut":false,"img":"bgblack","scaleY":1.5},"key":"setLayer"},{"para":{"noIn":false,"mirrow":false,"alpha":0.4,"addImg":"","layer":"bg","x":-500,"transTime":300,"y":-125,"scaleX":1.5,"trans":true,"bright":1,"noOut":false,"img":"bgblack","scaleY":1.5},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_11"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"noIn":false,"mirrow":false,"alpha":0,"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2b","layer":"chara2","x":340,"y":-180,"scaleX":1,"trans":true,"bright":1,"noOut":false,"img":"chara002_2","scaleY":1},"key":"setLayer"},{"para":{"noIn":false,"mirrow":false,"alpha":1,"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2b","layer":"chara2","x":340,"transTime":300,"y":-180,"scaleX":1,"trans":true,"bright":1,"noOut":false,"img":"chara002_2","scaleY":1},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"米托拉","text":"[show]嘿嘿。真正的好伙伴可不会因为这点小事而分离的！对吧，{myName}！[l]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_12"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"noIn":false,"mirrow":false,"alpha":1,"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2b","layer":"chara2","x":340,"transTime":300,"y":-180,"scaleX":1,"trans":true,"bright":0.6,"noOut":false,"img":"chara002_2","scaleY":1},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"options":[{"text":"没错的噗！","tag":"tag_13"}]},"key":"option"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_13"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"索洛罗哆","text":"[show][cm]刚、刚刚让你喝了那么难喝的东西……我、我要回去给你带点好喝的！稍、稍等一下的噗！[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_14"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"img":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2c","layer":"chara2"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"noIn":false,"mirrow":false,"alpha":1,"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2c","layer":"chara2","x":340,"transTime":300,"y":-180,"scaleX":1,"trans":true,"bright":1,"noOut":false,"img":"chara002_2","scaleY":1},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"米托拉","text":"[show]啊……跑掉了……[l]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_15"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"noIn":false,"mirrow":false,"alpha":1,"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2c","layer":"chara2","x":340,"transTime":300,"y":-180,"scaleX":1,"trans":true,"bright":0.6,"noOut":false,"img":"chara002_2","scaleY":1},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"options":[{"text":"看来是有些害羞。","tag":"tag_16"}]},"key":"option"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_16"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"维罗莎","text":"[show][cm]两位也辛苦了，让你们陪着我的好伙伴折腾了一路，真的非常抱歉。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_17"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"img":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2a","layer":"chara2"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"noIn":false,"mirrow":false,"alpha":1,"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2a","layer":"chara2","x":340,"transTime":300,"y":-180,"scaleX":1,"trans":true,"bright":1,"noOut":false,"img":"chara002_2","scaleY":1},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"米托拉","text":"[show]没事啦，这一路上也没遇到什么麻烦……[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_18"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"noIn":false,"mirrow":false,"alpha":1,"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2a","layer":"chara2","x":340,"transTime":300,"y":-180,"scaleX":1,"trans":true,"bright":0.6,"noOut":false,"img":"chara002_2","scaleY":1},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"维罗莎","text":"[show]话说……你们应该也去找了奥德吉哆老前辈吧？我猜这个药方，应该就是他的手笔。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_19"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"img":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2c","layer":"chara2"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"noIn":false,"mirrow":false,"alpha":1,"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2c","layer":"chara2","x":340,"transTime":300,"y":-180,"scaleX":1,"trans":true,"bright":1,"noOut":false,"img":"chara002_2","scaleY":1},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"米托拉","text":"[show]啊？你也知道奥德吉哆？莫非你认识他吗？[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_20"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"noIn":false,"mirrow":false,"alpha":0,"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2c","layer":"chara2","x":340,"transTime":300,"y":-180,"scaleX":1,"trans":true,"bright":1,"noOut":false,"img":"chara002_2","scaleY":1},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"noIn":false,"mirrow":false,"alpha":0,"addImg":"","layer":"bg","x":-500,"transTime":300,"y":-125,"scaleX":1.5,"trans":true,"bright":1,"noOut":false,"img":"bgblack","scaleY":1.5},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"维罗莎","text":"[show]我何止是认识他，在我小的时候，我也曾经去找过他。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_21"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"维罗莎","text":"[show]当时我听说他有治疗臭臭蕈的药方，所以特意从金弦之厅跑过来请教他。那应该已经是好几年前的事情了。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_22"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"维罗莎","text":"[show]他非常健忘……我连续跑了三次才把药方套了出来，但是等药熬制好了以后，我迟迟不敢拿去给索洛罗哆。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_23"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"维罗莎","text":"[show]她病好之后，肯定也会像正常蕈人一样生活，交上其他更好的朋友……我也害怕……她最后也会离开我。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_24"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"维罗莎","text":"[show]后来是奥德吉哆先生用同样的话说服了我，我才明白真正的友情，绝不会因为这种事而破碎。所以我后来也没再担心这些事情了。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_25"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"noIn":false,"mirrow":false,"alpha":0,"addImg":"","layer":"bg","x":-500,"y":-125,"scaleX":1.5,"trans":true,"bright":1,"noOut":false,"img":"bgblack","scaleY":1.5},"key":"setLayer"},{"para":{"noIn":false,"mirrow":false,"alpha":0.4,"addImg":"","layer":"bg","x":-500,"transTime":300,"y":-125,"scaleX":1.5,"trans":true,"bright":1,"noOut":false,"img":"bgblack","scaleY":1.5},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_26"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"noIn":false,"mirrow":false,"alpha":0,"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2e","layer":"chara2","x":340,"y":-180,"scaleX":1,"trans":true,"bright":1,"noOut":false,"img":"chara002_2","scaleY":1},"key":"setLayer"},{"para":{"noIn":false,"mirrow":false,"alpha":1,"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2e","layer":"chara2","x":340,"transTime":300,"y":-180,"scaleX":1,"trans":true,"bright":1,"noOut":false,"img":"chara002_2","scaleY":1},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"米托拉","text":"[show]原来还有这样的故事啊……我终于知道为什么奥德吉哆问我有没有喝药了……[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_27"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"noIn":false,"mirrow":false,"alpha":1,"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2e","layer":"chara2","x":340,"transTime":300,"y":-180,"scaleX":1,"trans":true,"bright":0.6,"noOut":false,"img":"chara002_2","scaleY":1},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"维罗莎","text":"[show]至于那个药管不管用……至少从我今天喝的药来看，八成是没用的，看来奥德吉哆先生也不太靠谱嘛……[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_28"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"img":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2h","layer":"chara2"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"noIn":false,"mirrow":false,"alpha":1,"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2h","layer":"chara2","x":340,"transTime":300,"y":-180,"scaleX":1,"trans":true,"bright":1,"noOut":false,"img":"chara002_2","scaleY":1},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"米托拉","text":"[show]那家伙……该不会是装健忘的吧，他那糟糕的记忆力可让我们白跑了好几趟啊……[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_29"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"noIn":false,"mirrow":false,"alpha":1,"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2h","layer":"chara2","x":340,"transTime":300,"y":-180,"scaleX":1,"trans":true,"bright":0.6,"noOut":false,"img":"chara002_2","scaleY":1},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"维罗莎","text":"[show]或许是真忘记了，或许是假忘记了，这种事情可能也只有老先生自己知道了吧。不过，我一直都很感谢他——[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_30"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"索洛罗哆","text":"[show]噗噗！摔倒了噗！[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_31"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"维罗莎","text":"[show]啊、索洛罗哆！没事吧？[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_32"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"","text":"[show]（维罗莎跑了过去……）[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_33"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"img":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2a","layer":"chara2"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"noIn":false,"mirrow":false,"alpha":1,"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2a","layer":"chara2","x":340,"transTime":300,"y":-180,"scaleX":1,"trans":true,"bright":1,"noOut":false,"img":"chara002_2","scaleY":1},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"米托拉","text":"[show]唉……不该怎么说，任务总算是结束了，也听到了一段不错的故事呢。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_34"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"img":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2b","layer":"chara2"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"米托拉","text":"[show]这样的友谊，真的感觉好好哦。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_35"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"img":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2a","layer":"chara2"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"米托拉","text":"[show]不过这种友谊，我们也早就拥有了，所以也不必羡慕。对吧，{myName}？[l]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_36"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"noIn":false,"mirrow":false,"alpha":1,"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2a","layer":"chara2","x":340,"transTime":300,"y":-180,"scaleX":1,"trans":true,"bright":0.6,"noOut":false,"img":"chara002_2","scaleY":1},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"options":[{"text":"那是当然啦噗！","tag":"tag_37"}]},"key":"option"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_37"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"img":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2b","layer":"chara2"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"noIn":false,"mirrow":false,"alpha":1,"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2b","layer":"chara2","x":340,"transTime":300,"y":-180,"scaleX":1,"trans":true,"bright":1,"noOut":false,"img":"chara002_2","scaleY":1},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"米托拉","text":"[show][cm]嘿嘿！能遇到{myName}，真是太好啦的噗～[l][cm][hide]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_38"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"noIn":false,"mirrow":false,"alpha":0,"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2b","layer":"chara2","x":340,"transTime":300,"y":-180,"scaleX":1,"trans":true,"bright":1,"noOut":false,"img":"chara002_2","scaleY":1},"key":"moveLayer"